{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112354","id":2974188863,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6xRoU_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112354","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112354.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112354.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112354","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112354/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112354/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112354/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f873f7b63b099ae495c98ba41f941f44e254b2cf","number":112354,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix MSVC version parsing for Visual Studio in methods.py","user":{"login":"jvastola","id":32178472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc4NDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32178472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola","html_url":"https://github.com/jvastola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jvastola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Description:\r\nThis PR updates the version parsing logic in methods.py to robustly extract only the numeric parts of the MSVC version string. This prevents a ValueError when building Godot with Visual Studio 2026 (Insiders) or newer, whose version strings include non-numeric text (e.g., \"Insiders\").\r\n\r\nDetails:\r\n\r\nUses regex to extract leading digits for major, minor, and patch version numbers.\r\nFixes build failure on new Visual Studio releases where the version string format changed.\r\nTesting:\r\n\r\nVerified that Godot now builds successfully with Visual Studio 2026 Developer Command Prompt.\r\nConfirmed that the fix does not affect builds with previous Visual Studio versions.\r\nRelated issues:\r\n\r\nFixes build error: [ValueError: invalid literal for int() with base 10: ' Insiders [ValueError: invalid literal for int() with base 10: ' Insiders [11123'](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/Admin/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-03T21:01:54Z